msgid "Create new user admin role"
msgstr "Create new user admin role"

msgid ""
"Create a user role for user administrators: users who should manage other "
"users. Pick the roles the administrator should be able to manage, and the "
"new role will be given all authorities of those roles. This follows the "
"DHIS2 user management concept that requires a user to have the same or more "
"privileges than the users they manage."
msgstr ""
"Create a user role for user administrators: users who should manage other "
"users. Pick the roles the administrator should be able to manage, and the "
"new role will be given all authorities of those roles. This follows the "
"DHIS2 user management concept that requires a user to have the same or more "
"privileges than the users they manage."

msgid "Update existing user role"
msgstr "Update existing user role"

msgid ""
"Select an existing role to see which user roles it can currently manage, "
"and extend it with the authorities of additional roles so its members can "
"manage users with those roles as well."
msgstr ""
"Select an existing role to see which user roles it can currently manage, "
"and extend it with the authorities of additional roles so its members can "
"manage users with those roles as well."

